10. POST /api/bookings/create
{
  "busId": "number (required)",
  "date": "string (required)",
  "seats": ["number"] (required, array, non-empty),
  "passengers": [
    {
      "name": "string (required)",
      "age": "number (required)",
      "gender": "string (required)",
      "seatNumber": "number (required)"
    }
  ] (required, array, length must match seats),
  "totalAmount": "number (required)"
}

{
  "message": "Booking confirmed successfully",
  "bookingId": "string (e.g., 'BK1234567890')",
  "booking": {
    "id": "number",
    "bookingId": "string",
    "busId": "number",
    "date": "string",
    "seats": ["number"],
    "totalAmount": "number",
    "status": "confirmed"
  }
}
* Error (400/401/403/404): { "error": "string" }

